<title>UK: No FTSE 100 stocks go ex-dividend.</title>
<headline>No FTSE 100 stocks go ex-dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>No stocks in the FTSE 100 index of UK stocks went ex-dividend on Monday, the London Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
